002615r 1               
002615r 1               ; the terminal scrolls the view left d characters (16, d times; the repeat
002615r 1               ; count must be 0 for whole characters).  The columns that come in on the
002615r 1               ; right are blank: so is the copy there; and they are marked for comparing.
002615r 1               hw_scroll:
