00271Cr 1               ; ---- the view from the map --------------------------------------------------------
00271Cr 1               ; wc holds the view: a page a text row, indexed by the world column & 255.
00271Cr 1               ; Scrolling only has to fill in the columns coming into view.
00271Cr 1               
00271Cr 1               ; tile columns X .. A
00271Cr 1               gen_cols:
00271Cr 1  8D rr rr             sta     g_end
00271Fr 1  8A           @l:     txa
